  "details": "- For the friend list and world list, what used to be one line suddenly became four columns, and it's hard to see. I also want a mode to arrange in two rows. Also, I would like to have a specification that not only aligns vertically, but also flows horizontally as before (maybe it's a matter of getting used to it).\n- I want Uploaded World to be sorted by Update Recently.\n- It's hard to use because the search tab serves as both a world search function and a user search function. When searching for a user after searching the world, if you access the search tab as it is, it will be the search for the world, so you have to press the search button once from the friends tab. If so, I don't think there is a need for a search tab.",
